import java.util.Optional;

public class OrElseGetLazyDemo {
    static String buildDefault() {
        System.out.println("building fallback");
        return "Guest";
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String name = Optional.of("Alice").orElseGet(
            OrElseGetLazyDemo::buildDefault);
        System.out.println(name);
    }
}
```
Here the supplier is not called, so only `Alice` is printed.

